    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13281" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπονενοημένως</span></b> , Adv., (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπονοέομαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>desperately,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				7.2.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DMort.</u>
				19.2
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἔχειν πρὸς τὰ
			γεύματα</span> to be <i>obstinately averse</i> to food, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				3.17
			</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β́; ἀ. διακεῖσθαι πρὸς τὸ
			ζῆν</span> to be <i>recklessly indifferent</i> to life, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				6.75
			</span></i>.</div>
